Repository Notes:
typeorm.io 
create() -> makes a new instance of an entity but does not persist it to the db.
save() -> adds or update a record to the db.
find() -> run a query and return the list of entities.
findOne() -> Run a query and returning the 1st record matching the search criteria.
remove() -> remove a record from the db.

save() -> insert() , update()
remove() -> delete()


